tempo 72
mode famicom
instrument 0 hikari @2 q8 ~6,14,40
  v: 5 8 11 13 14 15 | 14 / 11 8 5 3 1 0
instrument 1 yuragi @2 q8
  v: 15 13 12 11 10 9 9 8 8 7 7 6 6 5 | 5 / 3 2 1 0
part 0 @i0 v10
part 1 @i1 v6
part 2 q7
part 3
part 4

